# Mend Unified Agent configuration, read by Mend for GitHub because .whitesource sets configMode=LOCAL.
# The first six patterns are Mend's defaults. samples/ and alerting-ui-mockups/ are excluded because
# they are demo code that is not shipped with the product. Excluding a directory also stops
# resolvers from reading the manifests (requirements.txt, package.json) inside it.
excludes=**/.* **/node_modules **/src/test **/testdata **/*sources.jar **/*javadoc.jar **/samples/** **/alerting-ui-mockups/**
